[?2004l[?2004h> # Let's inspect SOP rule 3:
[?2004l[?2004h> # Allele balance: If the proband carries one copy of the ALT allele, the variant is accepted
[?2004l[?2004h> # only if the fraction of reads supporting the ALT allele, AD_alt / (AD_ref + AD_alt)
[?2004l[?2004h> # with the read counts of the ALT allele and of the GRCh38 reference allele, lies between 0.25 and 0.75.
[?2004l[?2004h> # What FORMAT fields are needed in trio.GRCh38.vcf.gz?
